        "answer": {
          "short": "37.5 drops/min",
          "worked": "Quantities: volume, time and drops.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Time}}&=\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Volume}}\\times\\frac{\\text{Volume}}{\\text{Time}}\\\\\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Time}}&=\\frac{15\\text{ drops}}{1\\text{ mL}}\\times\\frac{900\\text{ mL}}{6\\text{ h}}\\\\\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Time}}&=\\frac{15\\text{ drops}}{1\\text{ mL}}\\times\\frac{900\\text{ mL}}{360\\text{ min}}\\\\\\frac{\\text{Drops}}{\\text{Time}}&=37.5\\text{ drops/min}\\end{align*}$$",
